<title>SINGAPORE: Tianjin Zhongxin hits high of US$1.05.</title>
<headline>Tianjin Zhongxin hits high of US$1.05.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chinese drug company Tianjin Zhongxin Pharmaceutical Group Corp hit a high of US$1.05 in early Friday trade versus its initial public offer (IPO) price of US$0.68 per share.</p>
</text>
